{"sections":[{"slug":"对称幺半范畴的严格化","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"对称幺半范畴的严格化"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴的严格化</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"对称幺半范畴的严格化"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">给定对称幺半范畴</span> $\\mathsf C$, <span lang=\"zh\">存在与之等价的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称严格幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称严格幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf D$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathsf D$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象为</span> $\\mathsf C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">列表</span>”, <span lang=\"zh\">张量积为列表的拼接</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\pi\\colon \\operatorname{Ob}\\mathsf D\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathsf C$, <span lang=\"zh\">将列表</span> $A_1,\\cdots ,A_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应到</span> $A_1\\otimes(A_2\\otimes (\\cdots\\otimes A_n))$.</li>\n<li>$\\mathsf D$ <span lang=\"zh\">的态射为</span> $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf D}(X,Y):=\\{X\\}\\times\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf C}(\\pi(X),\\pi(Y))\\times\\{Y\\}$.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}